{"spread": 7, "blocks": [[{"t": "Managing Director\u2019s note", "font": "Roboto-Bold", "size": 22.7, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 55, 285, 85]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [285, 68, 288, 82]}], [{"t": "We launch this New Year issue of ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 98, 404, 112]}, {"t": "MINDMEP with a simple message: 2025 ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 110, 432, 124]}, {"t": "moved Mint forward.\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 122, 345, 136]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 134, 246, 148]}, {"t": "In Singapore, we stayed consistent ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 146, 416, 160]}, {"t": "where it matters most: repeat clients, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 158, 427, 172]}, {"t": "clean programmes, quality you can ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 170, 416, 184]}, {"t": "see. In Malaysia, we turned momentum ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 182, 433, 196]}, {"t": "into presence, building out work in ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 194, 413, 208]}, {"t": "Kuala Lumpur and Penang. In Thailand, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 206, 430, 220]}, {"t": "we entered, delivered, and handed over ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 218, 436, 232]}, {"t": "our first project, YETI\u2019s APAC workplace, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 230, 436, 244]}, {"t": "on a 14-week programme. New market, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 242, 431, 256]}, {"t": "same Mint standards.\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 254, 350, 268]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 266, 246, 280]}, {"t": "These are not just new pins on a map. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 278, 428, 292]}, {"t": "They reflect capability. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 290, 358, 304]}], [{"t": "Our BIM coordination is tighter, safety ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 314, 429, 328]}, {"t": "is firmer, and QA/QC is visible on site. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 326, 421, 340]}], [{"t": "We also began upgrading our BCA ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 350, 409, 364]}, {"t": "grading to L5 under Integrated ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 362, 395, 376]}, {"t": "Building Services, recognising who we ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 374, 430, 388]}, {"t": "are: an integrated delivery partner, not ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 386, 433, 400]}, {"t": "only an M&E installer.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 398, 345, 412]}], [{"t": "Mark Donlon ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Bold", "size": 16.2, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 298, 133, 321]}, {"t": "Managing Director, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 317, 124, 331]}, {"t": "Mint Building Services", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 329, 138, 343]}, {"t": "mark@mintbuildserv.com", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 343, 154, 357]}], [{"t": "We have added structure where it ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 98, 622, 112]}, {"t": "counts. The Commercial Director sets ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 110, 639, 124]}, {"t": "cost and contract discipline from bid ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 122, 638, 136]}, {"t": "to close-out. Two General Managers ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 134, 632, 148]}, {"t": "keep sites moving, resolve issues fast, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 146, 642, 160]}, {"t": "and keep quality visible. Clients get ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 158, 630, 172]}, {"t": "one clear point of contact, faster ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 170, 620, 184]}, {"t": "approvals, and predictable handovers.\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 182, 642, 196]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 194, 459, 208]}, {"t": "You will see that thread through this ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 206, 635, 220]}, {"t": "issue: from Old Bones, New Beats ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 218, 618, 232]}, {"t": "on conservation engineering, to the ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 230, 632, 244]}, {"t": "Thailand spotlight and profiles of the ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 242, 639, 256]}, {"t": "people leading our next phase. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 254, 608, 268]}, {"t": "The promise is unchanged. We do ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 266, 620, 280]}, {"t": "not just install systems. We engineer ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 278, 636, 292]}, {"t": "outcomes\u2014with agility, technical ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 290, 620, 304]}, {"t": "exactness, and a calm focus on ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 302, 611, 316]}, {"t": "quality.\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 314, 495, 328]}], [{"t": "Thank you to our clients, partners, and ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 338, 646, 352]}, {"t": "the Mint team for a strong year. Here\u2019s ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 350, 644, 364]}, {"t": "to a safe and prosperous 2026.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 362, 607, 376]}]]}